          </div>
          <div class="lesson-detail"><div class="lesson-detail-inner"></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-divider"></div>
          <div class="lesson-row locked">
            <div class="lesson-icon lesson-icon-locked">🔒</div>
            <div class="lesson-info"><h3>3. Tens &amp; Hundreds</h3><p>Building larger numbers efficiently</p></div>
            <div class="lesson-right"><span class="lesson-duration">8 min</span><span class="lesson-status-icon">🔒</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="lesson-detail"><div class="lesson-detail-inner"></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-divider"></div>
          <div class="lesson-row locked">
            <div class="lesson-icon lesson-icon-locked">🔒</div>
            <div class="lesson-info"><h3>4. Counting in Context</h3><p>Age, money, and time expressions</p></div>
            <div class="lesson-right"><span class="lesson-duration">9 min</span><span class="lesson-status-icon">🔒</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="lesson-detail"><div class="lesson-detail-inner"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ═══ UNIT 3 ═══ -->
    <div class="unit-card" data-unit="3">
      <div class="unit-header" onclick="toggleUnit(this)">
        <div class="unit-number" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2e6b4f,#2e9b6a)">3</div>
        <div class="unit-info">
          <h2>Module 3: Emotions &amp; Feelings</h2>
          <p>Express happiness, sadness, surprise, and more with nuanced facial grammar.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="unit-meta">
          <span class="unit-badge badge-locked">Locked</span>
          <span class="unit-lessons-count">5 lessons</span>
        </div>
        <div class="unit-chevron">▼</div>
      </div>
      <div class="unit-progress-mini">
        <div class="mini-track"><div class="mini-fill" style="width:0%"></div></div>
        <span class="mini-label">0 / 5 complete</span>
      </div>
      <div class="unit-body">
        <div class="lessons-list">
          <div class="lesson-row locked"><div class="lesson-icon lesson-icon-locked">🔒</div><div class="lesson-info"><h3>1. Happy &amp; Sad</h3><p>Core emotion handshapes and expressions</p></div><div class="lesson-right"><span class="lesson-duration">5 min</span><span class="lesson-status-icon">🔒</span></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-detail"><div class="lesson-detail-inner"></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-divider"></div>
          <div class="lesson-row locked"><div class="lesson-icon lesson-icon-locked">🔒</div><div class="lesson-info"><h3>2. Excited &amp; Nervous</h3><p>High-energy vs. low-energy signs</p></div><div class="lesson-right"><span class="lesson-duration">6 min</span><span class="lesson-status-icon">🔒</span></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-detail"><div class="lesson-detail-inner"></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-divider"></div>
          <div class="lesson-row locked"><div class="lesson-icon lesson-icon-locked">🔒</div><div class="lesson-info"><h3>3. Angry &amp; Frustrated</h3><p>Intensity modifiers and body language</p></div><div class="lesson-right"><span class="lesson-duration">7 min</span><span class="lesson-status-icon">🔒</span></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-detail"><div class="lesson-detail-inner"></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-divider"></div>
          <div class="lesson-row locked"><div class="lesson-icon lesson-icon-locked">🔒</div><div class="lesson-info"><h3>4. Surprised &amp; Confused</h3><p>Facial grammar for questions</p></div><div class="lesson-right"><span class="lesson-duration">5 min</span><span class="lesson-status-icon">🔒</span></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-detail"><div class="lesson-detail-inner"></div></div>
