          <div class="lesson-row locked"><div class="lesson-icon lesson-icon-locked">🔒</div><div class="lesson-info"><h3>5. Emotions in Sentences</h3><p>Combining emotion signs naturally</p></div><div class="lesson-right"><span class="lesson-duration">10 min</span><span class="lesson-status-icon">🔒</span></div></div>
