          <div class="lesson-detail"><div class="lesson-detail-inner"></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-divider"></div>
          <div class="lesson-row locked"><div class="lesson-icon lesson-icon-locked">🔒</div><div class="lesson-info"><h3>3. Talking About Family</h3><p>Family member signs and relationships</p></div><div class="lesson-right"><span class="lesson-duration">9 min</span><span class="lesson-status-icon">🔒</span></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-detail"><div class="lesson-detail-inner"></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-divider"></div>
          <div class="lesson-row locked"><div class="lesson-icon lesson-icon-locked">🔒</div><div class="lesson-info"><h3>4. Full Conversation Role-play</h3><p>End-to-end dialogue with AI partner</p></div><div class="lesson-right"><span class="lesson-duration">15 min</span><span class="lesson-status-icon">🔒</span></div></div>
          <div class="lesson-detail"><div class="lesson-detail-inner"></div></div>
